let __v_2149 = Value::from("The mean, which is what most people mean by an average, is the total shared out evenly: 4, 6 and 11 add to 21, and 21 ÷ 3 = 7, so the mean is 7. The median is the middle one once they are in order (6 above), and the mode is the value that appears most often.");
